    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      54.41,
      193.95,
      296.47,
      209.42
    ],
    "text": "Justice SaleemMarsoof, P. C, J. (PICA) observed,",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica-Oblique",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.399999618530273,
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.5,
      235.69,
      549.9,
      251.17
    ],
    "text": "That it is settled law that inordinate delay invoking the jurisdiction of the court does not entitle the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      11.642721176147461
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.62,
      256.58,
      550.0,
      272.08
    ],
    "text": "petitioners to any relief under writ jurisdiction. It is further stated that,no plausible explanation has",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      11.602072715759277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.61,
      277.21,
      549.54,
      292.69
    ],
    "text": "been given by the petitioner for his delay in invoking the jurisdiction of this court. In fact, the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      11.78054428100586
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.61,
      298.1,
      549.28,
      313.63
    ],
    "text": "petitioner did not give any direct explanation for his delay andl or admit the fact that there was delay.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      12.282838821411133
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.77,
      318.74,
      550.56,
      334.22
    ],
    "text": "However, without categorically admitting the delay, they attempted to mitigate his delay by stating",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      52.03,
      338.68,
      289.84,
      355.1
    ],
    "text": "that they made a complaint to the 2nd respondent.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.022982120513916,
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.76,
      380.5,
      521.66,
      396.78
    ],
    "text": "In the case of Juwanisvs.Lathief, Police Inspector, Special task force and others it was Held:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
