    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.94,
      463.94,
      281.35,
      479.41
    ],
    "text": "(where it is denied) before proceeding further.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      51.86,
      494.42,
      550.66,
      509.89
    ],
    "text": "\"The Court of Appeal can direct a judge of a Court of first instance to mqUIre into the alleged",
