      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      12.18452262878418
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      52.16,
      567.14,
      551.36,
      582.73
    ],
    "text": "\"It is not necessary for the Court of Appeal to satisfy itself that the corpus is within the custody or",
